      <h2>A home moving service that manages the whole move</h2>
      <p>Moving house usually means coordinating an estate agent, a solicitor, a removal company, a cleaner and a utilities provider, often while sorting and packing at the same time. Chayce Properties replaces that juggling with one dedicated coordinator who manages the whole move from first conversation to your first week in the new home.</p>
      <p>The service follows three stages: preparing, moving and settling in. We help you sort and declutter, stage the property if you are selling, pack, arrange a fully insured removal, liaise with your estate agent and solicitor, transfer utilities, clean the property you are leaving and unpack and set up the new one.</p>
      <p>We are based in Northampton and arrange moves across the whole UK. Packages start at &pound;995 for packing and removals, &pound;1,850 for a full-service move with a dedicated coordinator and &pound;3,250 for Gold Prestige, which adds solicitor coordination, home staging and up to six weeks of storage.</p>
      <div class="area-honest">
        <p>Start with a Discovery Consultation, from &pound;150, in person in Northampton or by phone. You get a personalised plan, timeline and budget before committing to anything.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

